---
description: apps/web — Next.js 15, Mantine 8, Hook-as-Controller (ADR 0013), Views Structure (ADR 0017)
globs: apps/web/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

`apps/web` only. HTTP to `apps/api` via same-origin `/api/*` BFF proxy.

- **Hook sebagai Controller (ADR 0013)**: State, side-effects, API calls, form validation, dan routing wajib di `apps/web/hooks/`. View murni presentasi.
- **Views Structure (ADR 0017)**: Halaman `app/` tipis mendelegasikan ke `views/<halaman>/`. Komponen lokal di `views/<halaman>/components/`. Folder `components/` hanya untuk UI generic reusable primitives (`PageShell`, `ItemCard`, `ErrorAlert`, `AppLink`, `OtpModal`).
- **API Mapping (ADR 0017)**: Endpoint FE `/api/*` wajib didaftarkan di `apps/web/lib/api-mapping.ts` dan diuji di `lib/api-mapping.test.ts`.
- **Mantine 8 (ADR 0011)**: No `style={{ … }}`. No inline styles. Default dark.
- **Payload (ADR 0016)**: Action payloads (`email`, `token`, `code`, `password`) in JSON body only. Never query params.
- **Auth (ADR 0010, 0012)**: Pages never import `next-auth`. Use `lib/auth-actions.ts` / `lib/server-api.ts`.
- **Dilarang**: Jangan import Prisma, BullMQ, atau Siray SDK di `apps/web`.
